      "A thunderclap of a movie. The last act left the whole theater silent.",
      "Gorgeous, devastating, and wickedly funny when it needs to be.",
      "Proof that blockbusters can still have a soul."
    ],
    "mixed": [
      "Visually sumptuous but emotionally distant — a beautiful shell.",
      "Half of a masterpiece. The other half forgot to write a third act.",
      "Ambitious to a fault. When it lands, it soars; when it doesn't, it drags.",
      "The performances outclass the script by a country mile.",
      "Style to burn and not much underneath it, but what a style.",
      "Overlong and uneven, yet somehow I'd watch it again."
